    "q-164234": {
      "dom_id": "step-q164234",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Given the hyperboloid of two sheets ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2}=-1$, find its $x$-intercepts.",
      "worked_solution": "To find the $x$-intercepts, we plug $y=0$ and $z=0$ into the equation: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{0}^{2}-{0}^{2} & =-1 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation has no (real) solutions. \n\nTherefore, the hyperboloid does not intersect the $x$-axis.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
