      "name": "Question 12",
      "problem": "What is the trace in the $xz$-plane of the hyperboloid of one sheet $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{5}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=1?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xz$-plane, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}-\\frac{{0}^{2}}{5}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of the ellipse in $xy$-plane.",
