      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "What is the trace in the $xz$-plane of the hyperboloid of one sheet $9{x}^{2}+8{y}^{2}-4{z}^{2}=1?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xz$-plane, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the hyperboloid. This gives: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{x}^{2}+8\\cdot {0}^{2}-4{z}^{2} & =1 \\\\ 9{x}^{2}-4{z}^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is the equation of a hyperbola in $xz$-plane.",
